type: ItemTurret
name: "[#C46BE3]Domium []RESEMP Turret"
description: '''
RESEMP stands for "Repair Supression Electromagnetic Pulse"
when the projectile hits a power building, like batteries, reactors & any buildings that uses power, it chains extra damage to other power buildings or units.
it also suppresses repairing buildings like menders & regen projectors.
lastly, it can home onto units/buildings.
'''
